  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.z5vJvWgdZBM0WUbb]{The Burden of Potential}</p><p>You have a card that keeps track of minor and major decisions you have made in place of another, gaining the power of potential as you make them. Once the card is empowered, you can use the @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.KzJvMxp23cF7ZCPb]{Cascade Potential} action. If you use this action, die while you have the card invested, if the granter of the card would die or spend a ten minute ritual to Dismiss the card, the card vanishes.</p>"
